      {
        "id": "R1.1",
        "text": "WHEN a customer engages about \"Customer experience for a national retail brand: returns and refunds, loyalty program, store pickup, online order support, and retention\", THE SYSTEM SHALL resolve within closed ontology journeys with measurable KPIs"
      },
      {
        "id": "R1.2",
        "text": "WHEN handle time or SLA degrades, THE SYSTEM SHALL surface graph-grounded next-best-actions rather than free-form advice"
      }
